{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/冰雪中的反抗","pageid":7126,"revid":20603,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%86%B0%E9%9B%AA%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%8D%E6%8A%97&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%86%B0%E9%9B%AA%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%8D%E6%8A%97&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%86%B0%E9%9B%AA%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%8D%E6%8A%97&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>冰雪中的反抗</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.86.B0.E9.9B.AA.E4.B8.AD.E7.9A.84.E5.8F.8D.E6.8A.97\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"冰雪中的反抗\"><b>冰雪中的反抗</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"技能 冰雪中的反抗.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b0/4hwr4x4qwliivx6c5projr2ma5cnovd.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%86%B0%E9%9B%AA%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%8D%E6%8A%97.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b0/4hwr4x4qwliivx6c5projr2ma5cnovd.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%86%B0%E9%9B%AA%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%8D%E6%8A%97.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b0/4hwr4x4qwliivx6c5projr2ma5cnovd.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />冰雪中的反抗\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[职业技能]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（领袖光环）场上所有&lt;露西亚&gt;的己方，攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，防御提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。对拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自然守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">自然守护</font></span></span>]的目标，伤害、穿透伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>；若目标处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"守护失效\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">守护失效</font></span></span>]，则伤害效果额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。<br />✦额外拥有光环，效果：场上所有己方，<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"警戒\" class=\"bili-tt\">[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"警戒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">警戒</font></span></span>]</span></span>、<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"反击\" class=\"bili-tt\">[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"反击\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">反击</font></span></span>]</span></span>及<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"先制\" class=\"bili-tt\">[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"先制\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">先制</font></span></span>]</span></span>次数增加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"警戒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">警戒</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"反击\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">反击</font></span></span>]及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"先制\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">先制</font></span></span>]时，依据最大可用次数提高攻击：每有<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">4%</font>攻击，至多<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>；若最大次数高于<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>次则攻击额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%AE%89%E5%A8%9C\" title=\"角色图鉴库/安娜\"><img alt=\"头像 安娜.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/8e/cl3jbox4657mprmrtd6q7g7st5m8pav.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">安娜</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"